{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月卒業シーズン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなも高校を卒業しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/12/9261072/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/12/9261072/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/12/9261072/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(今後はコスプレになっちゃうから現役の制服写真を沢山載せておこう...笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間に\n高校生生活が終わってびっくり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/12/9261072/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際・青春ー！ってよりもお仕事で忙しくって\n高校生らしいことほぼやってなくて、社会人って気持ちがずっとあったから、むしろ高校生だったのか！みたいな...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも卒業式を迎え\nいろいろ振り返ってみたら\nめっちゃ寂しくなって、、、\nああ高校生楽しかったなー！って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校に友達が沢山って訳じゃなかったけど\n仲良くなった子みんな優しくて\n中々仕事で学校通うの大変だったけど\n周りの環境がよくて無事卒業できました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/12/9261072/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生にも\nいっぱい助けられた3年間だったなー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1・2年の担任も3年の担任も\nすっごい優しくて大好きだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業しても遊びにおいでねって言われた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/12/9261072/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい学校だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/12/9261072/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(卒業式でお友達と撮ったやつきりとった)"}],"source":"archive"}